  padding: 0;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--ds-text);
  /* Document text is 16px (AGENTS UI/UX); the body token is 14px, so the large body token is used.
     The reading line height (1.75) is set after the shorthand, which would otherwise reset it. */
