/*
 * Brand palette (S1, S2). The brand is Atlassian purple, built with the ADS Color Anatomy roles:
 * bold (filled actions and selected state), subtlest/subtler (tinted surfaces), text, icon,
 * border and link. The steps come from the ADS purple scale in the vendored tokens. Brand-bold
 * pairs are picked for AAA text contrast (7:1): white on #673286 is 8.8:1 in light mode, the
 * dark surface color on #D8A0F7 is 8.1:1 in dark mode. Neutral, danger, warning, success and
 * information tokens are left as ADS defines them. Loaded after the vendored files so these win.
 */
html[data-color-mode="light"][data-theme~="light:light"] {
  --ds-background-brand-subtlest: #F8EEFE;
  --ds-background-brand-subtlest-hovered: #EED7FC;
  --ds-background-brand-subtlest-pressed: #E3BDFA;
  --ds-background-brand-bold: #673286;
